      <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="计算机网络知识梳理" data-numberify>计算机网络知识梳理<a class="anchor ms-1" href="#计算机网络知识梳理"></a></h1>

<h2 id="前言" data-numberify>前言<a class="anchor ms-1" href="#前言"></a></h2>
<p>在b站上看到逊哥的课，讲的很好啊！</p>
<p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1p69tYZEvN/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=9c22157b2c924857f42d806788cc5fea" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">计算机网络技术（可用于408备考）也许是全网讲的最通俗易懂的计算机网络课程<i class="fas fa-external-link-square-alt ms-1"></i></a></p>
<p>推荐一下(点了关注)，此篇可能极大程度上参考逊哥的课来写，这里也纠正了我发现逊哥的一些小错误。</p>
<p>我认为期末考试的重点内容大概有：（如果你时间不够的话可以只看看这些）</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 1</span><span class="cl">模块一：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 2</span><span class="cl">	OSI参考模型
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 3</span><span class="cl">	网络交换方式
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 4</span><span class="cl">模块二：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 5</span><span class="cl">	信道复用技术
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 6</span><span class="cl">模块三：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 7</span><span class="cl">	CRC循环冗余校验
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 8</span><span class="cl">	停止等待、后退n帧，选择重传协议
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 9</span><span class="cl">	CSMA/CD、CSMA/CA协议
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">10</span><span class="cl">	以太网
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">11</span><span class="cl">模块四：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">12</span><span class="cl">	路由算法
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">13</span><span class="cl">	域内路由与域间路由协议
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">14</span><span class="cl">	IPv4数据报
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">15</span><span class="cl">	IP地址
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">16</span><span class="cl">	CIDR及子网划分、路由聚合
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">17</span><span class="cl">	ICMP、DHCP、ARP协议
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">18</span><span class="cl">模块五：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">19</span><span class="cl">	UDP与TCP特性
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">20</span><span class="cl">	TCP三次握手，四次挥手
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">21</span><span class="cl">	TCP超时重传、快速重传、累计确认
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">22</span><span class="cl">	TCP流量控制与拥塞控制
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">23</span><span class="cl">模块六：
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">24</span><span class="cl">	应用层协议
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>那我们废话不多说直接进入正题</p>

<h2 id="正题" data-numberify>正题<a class="anchor ms-1" href="#正题"></a></h2>

<h3 id="模块一概述--体系结构总分结构" data-numberify>模块一：概述 & 体系结构（总分结构）<a class="anchor ms-1" href="#模块一概述--体系结构总分结构"></a></h3>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li><strong>OSI七层 vs TCP/IP四层（408必考）</strong>： 重点是两者的对应关系与“5层参考模型”。</li>
<li><strong>关键概念扫雷</strong>： 速率、带宽、吞吐量、时延（发送/传播/处理/排队）、时延带宽积、RTT。</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>

<h4 id="历史" data-numberify>历史<a class="anchor ms-1" href="#历史"></a></h4>
<p>从世界上第一台计算机ENIAC开始，随着计算机的产生，人们就开始想能不能把计算机与计算机之间进行连接，形成一个网络呢？于是美国国防部做了世界上最早的分组交换网络——ARPANET(阿帕网)，如下图所示<picture><img class="img-fluid " alt="msedge_CYY1qPcTh3" src="https://decimo.top/images/screenshoots/2026-06/msedge_CYY1qPcTh3.png?v=2b95c26849b6a52e162794a454185af3" loading="lazy" width="1464" height="797" />
</picture>

</p>]]></description>
